<description>&lt;p&gt;Egypt reopened its embassy in Tripoli, restoring diplomatic ties after twelve years, while Libyan authorities detained a translator and arrested a man for throwing grenades at the army in Tripoli. A fire triggered an explosion at the Marsa Brega gas complex, killing one worker and injuring four. ISIS militants killed a young Christian man after he refused to deny Jesus. Combat intensity remains low, with 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxOR29zQkdqakNMVzQ3c3d2dEtoN2M3VXAxa0d6MFdKSm5Cbzk2dzJZWUhyRE8yUUFDclBzQjJJNThDYVZaMERlbU9rS3JLOE5rQlZLSi1idS1zNUYwbndmaDNCZG0taXM1SjFYc0lOb3pFQ0lBRWlYaDF4OWlxa0VVWnVYZWlialNQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Мілітарний&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;WFMZ.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxQQ0VYbGxXb2dZeDljOGZSU01tWmNpcktQbW1tWnVRZGdoTEZ6Y3BVOWRQQXNYSDhnVWVQdUoyR05HQVJnV29sZV96UTA4dGZUdlRJM3E0ZUZVZVF5QzJ4V1JWNTI2WnpadWdTVUdrZFQxOEw4OHU2elVwQU9FaXdjUmZrY2dqSFhzQWZxdnl3M2Rkdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Libya Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxNamxSb2ZyNXhNSUNSaGJ0VXFKLWtUVDB1b1VPS205MnEzZk0tOUpMSVBEQXZ0ZFlVWm4yUXN3Y3dTakozYmZRVTFOVW55T2pGYW93N1MzdGRWaEFTeXU1M3ctMjk2eGFwN19jRkRxaGVfaXNyUHRqaGw4MWEweW14NGNTcFVNcWNaTUg4WQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Libya Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxPQzRRLUc5UExZak84ZmRqVDdwVXgtMm1FVHdDZUF3bEViNWt0bGpJMUROMmRzbzBtTnNyRWk5T3R6RmdHQjFmZXY4TUt3bjVKY0N5NWNQeVA5SGRCS1dVbzljdGYxQnM2ZnpSNDN3Z0NqNG01WDhxbFNXVjlsbXVMc3Z1MDlDUTNLd0FCZjJHOEI5LWR1TENpNzgxc2d1dE4yd2VGZ3BHYkJjclZVZ1UwZGdSTTlFazB1UE16enpOdVUxZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Atlantic Council&lt;/a&